{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Spellcasting feature, ability to cast spells of 2nd level or higher.\n\nThanks to study or deep introspection, you have achieved a firm grasp on spellcasting fundamentals, granting you the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- If you learn spells, you learn a number of spells of your choice of 5th level or lower from your class’s spell list equal to your proficiency bonus, which don\u0027t count against your total number of spells known and which you always have prepared and must be from a level at which you can cast spell slots. Whenever your proficiency bonus increases thereafter, you can add an additional spell with that meets the prerequisites to the spells always prepared with this feature.\n\n- You can use your action to divide a higher-level spell slot into two or more lower-level spell slots whose combined level is equal to or less than the original slot’s level. You can’t convert these spell slots into sorcery points.","level":1}],"id":"Custom87a94af3-650e-4222-afd3-f9246f3685d5","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Downcaster [VSS] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}